  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7ad8b8a65076ed44e8b31e15d6fdab35, type: 3}
  m_Name: IntroStory
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Dialogue:
    Name: 
    Sentences:
    - Once upon a time, in a small and quiet town nestled amidst murmuring woods
      and winding rivers, there lived a cat named Felix.
    - 'Felix was known throughout the town for his kindness and friendly nature.
      But little did anyone know, Felix had lost all memory of his past. '
    - The only clue to his mysterious origins was a weathered stamp adorned with
      the image of a mighty soaring eagle.
    - One day, a peculiar letter arrived at Felix's doorstep. The envelope, bearing
      the very same eagle stamp, ignited a flame of inspiration within Felix's heart.
    - With a newfound purpose, he decided to recruit more feline friends to help
      him build a mail delivery business in the hopes of encountering a client who
      used the same stamps as him.
